---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="案例"
  description="弈藤实业 AI GEO 服务案例展示。"
  path="/cases/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">客户案例</p>
      <h1>真实场景中的 AI 可见度变化</h1>
      <p>案例页面结构已预留，待客户脱敏资料和效果数据确认后逐条补充。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-3">
        {
          [1, 2, 3].map((item) => (
            <article class="card">
              <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{String(item).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
              <h3>案例标题待补充</h3>
              <p>行业、目标 AI、优化周期、核心动作与效果指标待补充。</p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <div class="empty-state" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <strong>案例库整理中</strong>
        <p>拿到真实项目资料后，这里会替换为结构化案例详情页。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
